WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:31.849
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:32.119 --> 00:33.560
My name is Liu Xuemei.

3
00:33.960 --> 00:35.520
I'm 32 years old.

4
00:35.719 --> 00:38.759
I'm a beer taster at State-Owned Lacheng Brewery.

5
00:39.359 --> 00:40.880
As a beer taster,

6
00:41.280 --> 00:43.039
our job is very important.

7
00:45.799 --> 00:47.880
I really like my coworkers.

8
00:48.560 --> 00:50.520
They're like family to me.

9
00:50.719 --> 00:52.719
And I really like our brewery.

10
00:55.200 --> 00:56.119
What else should I say?

11
00:56.759 --> 00:57.280
Anything.

12
00:57.600 --> 00:58.880
Say whatever's on your mind.

13
00:59.600 --> 01:01.600
Talk about your dreams, your hobbies,

14
01:01.719 --> 01:02.679
your hopes for the factory.

15
01:03.039 --> 01:03.799
Anything at all.

16
01:06.040 --> 01:07.359
I hope my son

17
01:07.439 --> 01:09.280
gets good grades on his final exams.

18
01:10.040 --> 01:12.000
He's eight years old this year.

19
01:12.359 --> 01:14.079
I hope he gets into a good college someday.

20
01:14.239 --> 01:15.519
Good.

21
03:05.080 --> 03:05.639
Master.

22
03:05.639 --> 03:06.319
Quick.

23
03:08.000 --> 03:08.759
What's wrong?

24
03:11.199 --> 03:12.439
Why are you being so cautious again?

25
03:13.240 --> 03:14.039
Did something happen?

26
03:17.039 --> 03:18.000
Why isn't Haipeng here yet?

27
03:18.199 --> 03:19.159
I didn't ask him to come today.

28
03:21.879 --> 03:22.719
Because last time,

29
03:23.439 --> 03:24.199
right in the middle of our chat,

30
03:24.199 --> 03:25.000
the cops showed up.

31
03:25.319 --> 03:26.680
We didn't get to finish what we were saying.

32
03:28.039 --> 03:28.800
These past couple of days,

33
03:29.400 --> 03:30.759
I figured something out.

34
03:32.080 --> 03:32.680
What is it?

35
03:34.680 --> 03:35.159
A traitor.

36
03:35.439 --> 03:35.879
Trai--

37
03:39.039 --> 03:40.159
What traitor?

38
03:42.000 --> 03:42.759
Look, Chen.

39
03:43.840 --> 03:46.159
The money we pooled back then to buy the factory...

40
03:46.520 --> 03:47.840
How did Ma Guowen find out about it?

41
03:48.319 --> 03:49.280
Someone definitely told him.

42
03:52.560 --> 03:53.360
An informant.

43
03:53.680 --> 03:54.080
Right.

44
03:54.919 --> 03:57.039
But that person definitely wasn't Liu Xuemei.

45
03:57.560 --> 03:58.639
It's definitely not Xuemei.

46
04:01.159 --> 04:02.599
Then... who was it?

47
04:03.080 --> 04:03.639
Shen Leshui.

48
04:06.960 --> 04:07.719
Her?

49
04:09.599 --> 04:10.639
Why didn't I think of that?

50
04:11.240 --> 04:13.319
No wonder you didn't call Haipeng today.

51
04:17.720 --> 04:18.560
I'm just guessing, but...

52
04:20.560 --> 04:22.160
she knew Ma Guowen first,

53
04:22.720 --> 04:23.920
and only got close to us later.

54
04:24.360 --> 04:24.800
Right?

55
04:25.480 --> 04:26.160
And in the end,

56
04:26.879 --> 04:27.800
what happened to us,

57
04:27.959 --> 04:29.480
she didn't put any of it in her film.

58
04:30.079 --> 04:31.879
Instead, she aired a cut that satisfied Ma Guowen.

59
04:32.040 --> 04:32.560
She even won an award for it.

60
04:33.040 --> 04:34.040
Everything worked out for them.

61
04:35.120 --> 04:35.879
It's been over ten years, right?

62
04:36.360 --> 04:37.240
Over ten years.

63
04:37.439 --> 04:38.639
The moment Ma Guowen talked about selling the factory,

64
04:38.959 --> 04:39.680
she came back.

65
04:41.040 --> 04:42.199
Aren't they in cahoots?

66
04:42.319 --> 04:42.879
Aren't they?

67
04:43.120 --> 04:43.920
Master is right.

68
04:44.680 --> 04:46.040
That day, right after she walked in,

69
04:46.199 --> 04:47.079
the cops came right in after her.

70
04:48.959 --> 04:50.399
You mean that time?

71
04:50.920 --> 04:52.720
When she showed us that dark silhouette on her camera?

72
04:53.399 --> 04:54.120
You couldn't see anything.

73
04:54.600 --> 04:55.000
That's right.

74
04:55.079 --> 04:57.519
Could she have been fishing for info from us?

75
04:57.920 --> 04:58.800
Exactly!

76
04:59.279 --> 05:00.120
Ever since she came back,

77
05:00.560 --> 05:02.120
she's been chatting up all the old-timers one by one.

78
05:02.759 --> 05:03.720
Even I was fooled by her.

79
05:04.600 --> 05:05.240
I thought to myself,

80
05:05.480 --> 05:07.399
"Look how much she cherishes old bonds."

81
05:08.480 --> 05:09.360
Now I get it.

82
05:09.680 --> 05:10.800
She was just fishing for information.

83
05:12.560 --> 05:13.519
Master is right.

84
05:16.240 --> 05:17.079
So what do you want to do?

85
05:18.040 --> 05:19.120
Those videotapes...

86
05:20.839 --> 05:21.399
Get our hands on them.

87
05:23.279 --> 05:25.240
The entire process of us buying the factory back then,

88
05:25.639 --> 05:26.439
she recorded all of it.

89
05:27.439 --> 05:28.240
In those tapes of hers,

90
05:28.680 --> 05:30.680
there must be clues about that traitor.

91
05:31.240 --> 05:32.319
Once we find this traitor,

92
05:32.519 --> 05:34.079
we can clear Xuemei's name.

93
05:34.079 --> 05:34.439
Right.

94
05:37.439 --> 05:38.879
I... I think,

95
05:40.920 --> 05:41.519
when dealing with her,

96
05:42.480 --> 05:43.199
we can't just use brute force.

97
05:43.800 --> 05:45.199
We need to be clever.

98
05:45.519 --> 05:46.439
I've already arranged everything.

99
05:48.120 --> 05:49.519
Just follow Master's plan.

100
06:13.560 --> 06:14.160
Tieping.

101
06:15.720 --> 06:17.279
Testing the radio.

102
06:19.160 --> 06:19.920
Zero-Two, Zero-Two.

103
06:19.920 --> 06:21.000
Zero-Two, Zero-Two, this is Zero-One.

104
06:21.000 --> 06:22.160
This is Zero-One. Do you copy?

105
06:22.160 --> 06:23.079
Please respond.

106
06:24.480 --> 06:25.279
Copy that.

107
06:27.160 --> 06:27.920
Good, good.

108
06:27.920 --> 06:28.920
Stand by. Stand by.

109
06:29.519 --> 06:30.120
The lights are off.

110
06:31.040 --> 06:31.680
The lights went out.

111
06:35.279 --> 06:37.000
The... the hallway light is on.

112
06:37.319 --> 06:38.000
He's out.

113
06:40.079 --> 06:41.879
He's coming down, coming down, coming down!

114
06:54.439 --> 06:54.920
Master.

115
06:55.560 --> 06:56.800
Target's out of the building.

116
07:06.120 --> 07:06.519
Stay on him.

117
07:07.439 --> 07:07.879
Copy that.

118
07:31.920 --> 07:32.600
Zero-Two, Zero-Two.

119
07:33.000 --> 07:33.600
This is Zero-One.

120
07:34.600 --> 07:35.519
Do you copy? Come in.

121
07:36.560 --> 07:37.240
Copy.

122
07:37.720 --> 07:38.759
What's the target doing?

123
07:39.160 --> 07:40.399
He's on foot right now.

124
07:42.480 --> 07:42.959
Good.

125
07:44.000 --> 07:44.839
Keep eyes on him.

126
07:45.360 --> 07:46.079
Stay in touch.

127
07:46.800 --> 07:47.480
Copy that.

128
07:54.000 --> 07:54.480
Let's go.

129
08:27.319 --> 08:27.920
This door.

130
08:28.480 --> 08:29.639
Three... 302.

131
08:34.799 --> 08:36.320
You even brought this?

132
08:37.919 --> 08:38.519
Isn't it empty?

133
08:40.200 --> 08:41.279
Someone still lives here?

134
08:41.960 --> 08:42.480
Tu.

135
08:42.480 --> 08:43.039
Yeah.

136
08:43.759 --> 08:44.320
Keep it down.

137
08:45.120 --> 08:46.039
I had no idea.

138
08:46.840 --> 08:49.240
You even know how to pick locks?

139
08:49.519 --> 08:50.200
That's nothing.

140
08:50.840 --> 08:53.080
We were skilled workers, after all.

141
08:54.759 --> 08:55.440
Got it?

142
08:59.399 --> 09:00.000
Don't rush me.

143
09:00.000 --> 09:00.799
I can't see.

144
09:01.919 --> 09:04.080
Go to the car and grab my reading glasses.

145
09:04.200 --> 09:05.279
What do you need reading glasses for?

146
09:06.799 --> 09:07.320
I brought mine.

147
09:08.759 --> 09:09.440
Mine are +2.50.

148
09:10.200 --> 09:10.759
Will that work?

149
09:11.200 --> 09:13.000
Anything under +3.00 is totally useless.

150
09:13.279 --> 09:14.799
+3.00 isn't enough?

151
09:22.519 --> 09:23.480
You do it. You do it.

152
09:24.080 --> 09:25.000
Just stick it in.

153
09:25.320 --> 09:25.960
I don't know how.

154
09:27.279 --> 09:28.240
Never done this before.

155
09:28.600 --> 09:29.039
What?

156
09:29.840 --> 09:30.759
Afraid of getting a criminal record?

157
09:31.200 --> 09:32.080
Wh-What...

158
09:32.080 --> 09:32.840
What criminal record?

159
09:33.399 --> 09:35.000
Why be so sneaky at a time like this? No way.

160
09:35.159 --> 09:36.000
Just stick it in,

161
09:36.240 --> 09:37.679
and give it a twist.

162
09:39.360 --> 09:39.840
Put on gloves.

163
09:40.399 --> 09:41.000
No fingerprints.

164
09:41.000 --> 09:41.759
No need, no need.

165
09:41.960 --> 09:43.480
I... I have gloves.

166
09:47.000 --> 09:48.200
Leather ones, too.

167
09:49.240 --> 09:49.799
Here, here.

168
09:49.799 --> 09:50.159
Give it to me.

169
09:50.200 --> 09:51.039
See that?

170
09:51.080 --> 09:51.399
Just...

171
09:51.440 --> 09:51.840
All right, all right.

172
09:51.879 --> 09:52.279
Shove it in.

173
09:52.320 --> 09:53.679
Yeah, got it.

174
10:01.919 --> 10:03.519
Old Cheng, get back here!

175
10:23.759 --> 10:24.360
Tu Chunyan!

176
10:24.600 --> 10:25.080
Get out here!

177
10:25.519 --> 10:26.200
Who is it?

178
10:26.440 --> 10:27.159
Come out!

179
10:30.600 --> 10:31.639
What's your problem?

180
10:31.919 --> 10:33.200
You've gone way too far!

181
10:33.200 --> 10:34.600
Dumping such a huge pile of trash at my door!

182
10:35.360 --> 10:35.799
Good grief!

183
10:35.799 --> 10:37.840
Which eye saw me put it there?

184
10:39.120 --> 10:40.440
If it wasn't you, then who? Me?

185
10:40.879 --> 10:41.320
Take it away!

186
10:42.440 --> 10:43.440
This isn't mine!

187
10:43.799 --> 10:44.600
I'm opening it up.

188
10:44.879 --> 10:45.799
If it's not mine,

189
10:45.799 --> 10:46.919
you're gonna eat it!

190
10:51.120 --> 10:52.000
Holy crap!

191
10:52.360 --> 10:53.159
Are you a ghost?!

192
10:53.639 --> 10:54.399
Master! Master!

193
10:54.440 --> 10:55.399
Shen Leshui is back home!

194
10:56.480 --> 10:57.039
Master!

195
10:57.559 --> 10:58.960
Shen Leshui is back home!

196
11:00.240 --> 11:00.840
Master!

197
11:01.960 --> 11:03.399
Shen Leshui is back home!

198
11:04.759 --> 11:05.679
Oh, good grief!

199
11:05.919 --> 11:07.159
Shen Leshui is back home, Old Cheng!

200
11:07.159 --> 11:08.240
What are you doing here?

201
11:08.559 --> 11:09.720
What are you doing here?

202
11:11.759 --> 11:12.320
Copy that.

203
11:14.559 --> 11:15.519
I'm the traitor?

204
11:16.200 --> 11:16.879
Where's the proof?

205
11:20.600 --> 11:22.159
You broke into my place,

206
11:22.320 --> 11:23.519
and got caught red-handed!

207
11:25.799 --> 11:26.759
Look at how old you are!

208
11:26.759 --> 11:27.799
What are you all doing?

209
11:27.799 --> 11:29.120
I was wondering what all that rustling was.

210
11:29.120 --> 11:30.559
Turns out you two were picking the lock!

211
11:32.679 --> 11:33.200
Zhao Haipeng,

212
11:33.720 --> 11:34.480
did you know about this?

213
11:36.360 --> 11:37.120
How would I know?

214
11:38.039 --> 11:39.559
Didn't you tell me to come over?

215
11:41.600 --> 11:44.039
If you want to watch the tapes, just ask me for them.

216
11:44.519 --> 11:46.480
Did you really have to resort to underhanded tricks?

217
11:50.879 --> 11:51.360
Master,

218
11:51.840 --> 11:53.080
Shen Leshui went home.

219
11:53.480 --> 11:55.720
I'm heading to the rendezvous point to meet you now.

220
11:58.879 --> 11:59.480
Oh, great.

221
12:00.279 --> 12:01.519
Not only did you pick my lock,

222
12:02.080 --> 12:03.159
you even had someone tail me.

223
12:04.000 --> 12:05.000
Look at Tieping,

224
12:06.000 --> 12:07.039
and then you, Old Tian...

225
12:07.759 --> 12:09.000
How did you teach your apprentice?

226
12:15.519 --> 12:15.919
Leshui,

227
12:18.919 --> 12:20.879
look at how old they are.

228
12:22.320 --> 12:23.759
Besides, you're all old friends,

229
12:23.960 --> 12:24.440
right?

230
12:25.320 --> 12:25.759
This... this...

231
12:25.759 --> 12:27.039
There must be some misunderstanding.

232
12:27.879 --> 12:28.519
Let it go.

233
12:29.240 --> 12:30.200
Cut them some slack.

234
12:30.759 --> 12:31.159
What do you say?

235
12:34.159 --> 12:35.200
Let it go, Leshui.

236
12:36.240 --> 12:37.559
You're both practically bald.

237
12:38.279 --> 12:40.120
If I haul you to the police station,

238
12:40.399 --> 12:42.039
it'll just cause trouble for the officers.

239
12:42.279 --> 12:43.519
As if they don't have enough to deal with.

240
12:47.879 --> 12:49.559
I'll pretend this never happened today.

241
12:50.279 --> 12:51.080
Don't let it happen again.

242
12:52.759 --> 12:53.600
Never again, you hear?

243
12:56.559 --> 12:56.840
All right.

244
12:58.360 --> 12:59.159
Let me pour you some water.

245
13:02.200 --> 13:02.559
You...

246
13:03.519 --> 13:04.519
That crooked reporter...

247
13:06.279 --> 13:07.399
about us buying the factory,

248
13:07.519 --> 13:09.639
she didn't include any of it in the documentary.

249
13:10.559 --> 13:11.159
Think about it!

250
13:11.559 --> 13:13.840
From start to finish, she was the only one who profited.

251
13:14.279 --> 13:15.720
If not you, who else would we suspect?

252
13:23.759 --> 13:25.080
Come on, Chen, are you ever gonna drop this?

253
13:31.039 --> 13:32.360
I couldn't help you back then,

254
13:32.960 --> 13:33.960
and that's on me.

255
13:35.200 --> 13:36.679
But from start to finish,

256
13:37.120 --> 13:38.480
I never betrayed you.

257
13:40.480 --> 13:41.399
Where are those tapes of yours?

258
13:41.960 --> 13:43.240
There must be some secret in them.

259
13:43.960 --> 13:45.240
The tapes were stolen!

260
13:45.919 --> 13:47.080
Zhao Haipeng knows about it.

261
13:47.919 --> 13:50.440
Didn't you ask him during your little secret meetups?

262
13:54.039 --> 13:56.000
So you don't even include me in group activities anymore?

263
13:58.120 --> 13:58.720
What's that supposed to mean?

264
13:59.759 --> 14:01.279
So you two suspect me too, huh?

265
14:03.279 --> 14:03.879
No...

266
14:04.799 --> 14:05.399
Well...

267
14:06.320 --> 14:06.879
Haipeng...

268
14:07.200 --> 14:08.240
weren't you, you know...

269
14:08.240 --> 14:09.679
We just didn't want you to, you know...

270
14:09.759 --> 14:10.879
What "you know"?

271
14:11.559 --> 14:12.200
Busy.

272
14:12.200 --> 14:13.080
You're busy, exactly.

273
14:13.840 --> 14:14.840
Unbelievable, you guys.

274
14:15.559 --> 14:16.399
Well, we didn't know

275
14:16.759 --> 14:18.240
her tapes were stolen.

276
14:20.840 --> 14:21.600
Who stole them?

277
14:34.200 --> 14:35.039
What do you mean?

278
14:37.039 --> 14:38.080
Why are you all staring at me?

279
14:38.559 --> 14:39.480
Come on, this is ridiculous.

280
14:41.360 --> 14:43.120
I live right across from her,

281
14:43.960 --> 14:44.320
right?

282
14:44.320 --> 14:46.559
I've only been to her place twice.

283
14:46.879 --> 14:47.639
Right, Shen Leshui?

284
14:48.000 --> 14:49.200
Every time I came over, she was home.

285
14:49.200 --> 14:50.399
I couldn't have stolen your tapes.

286
14:50.399 --> 14:50.720
Am I right?

287
14:50.720 --> 14:51.639
Say something!

288
14:57.159 --> 14:58.919
I suspect Gao Xuelin stole them.

289
15:00.360 --> 15:00.879
Who?

290
15:01.399 --> 15:04.039
That cop who came to Old Workers' Haven

291
15:04.720 --> 15:06.159
to question us.

292
15:06.840 --> 15:07.639
That young kid.

293
15:09.799 --> 15:10.799
Why do you suspect him?

294
15:15.679 --> 15:17.000
His father and Liu Xuemei

295
15:17.559 --> 15:18.480
died on the same day.

296
15:22.120 --> 15:23.080
In fact,

297
15:24.240 --> 15:25.759
he might've been Liu Xuemei's lover.

298
15:26.240 --> 15:26.879
What?

299
15:29.120 --> 15:31.080
Gao Xuelin's father

300
15:31.240 --> 15:32.399
was Liu Xuemei's

301
15:33.000 --> 15:34.480
lover in Qingzhou.

302
15:34.639 --> 15:35.679
So what you're saying is,

303
15:36.759 --> 15:38.120
that cop named Gao

304
15:38.559 --> 15:40.000
stole the tapes for his father?

305
15:41.120 --> 15:42.120
Not just the tapes.

306
15:42.639 --> 15:43.919
He probably committed murder, too.

307
15:49.960 --> 15:51.120
Whether he killed anyone or not,

308
15:51.519 --> 15:52.399
he's definitely suspicious.

309
15:54.000 --> 15:55.639
The police probably don't know yet

310
15:55.639 --> 15:57.159
that his father and Liu Xuemei

311
15:57.879 --> 15:59.039
were so closely tied.

312
16:00.639 --> 16:02.799
If we give this to the police,

313
16:03.279 --> 16:05.639
it might speed up the case.

314
16:12.759 --> 16:13.919
That's terrifying.

315
16:15.519 --> 16:16.120
Master, Master.

316
16:16.279 --> 16:17.559
I've reached the rendezvous point.

317
16:18.000 --> 16:18.559
Please advise.

318
16:20.679 --> 16:21.240
Master, Master.

319
16:21.399 --> 16:22.679
I've reached the rendezvous point.

320
16:22.799 --> 16:23.360
Please advise.

321
17:17.640 --> 17:18.240
Take it easy.

322
17:18.240 --> 17:19.599
My ribs hurt.

323
17:21.799 --> 17:22.160
All right?

324
17:22.759 --> 17:24.440
Don't take your frustration out on the bed.

325
17:24.680 --> 17:25.279
Come on, will you?

326
17:25.279 --> 17:25.880
Say something.

327
17:25.880 --> 17:26.880
Fine, fine, that's enough.

328
17:29.599 --> 17:30.440
Tell me about it.

329
17:30.680 --> 17:31.160
What's going on?

330
17:33.119 --> 17:33.880
I'm not supposed to say.

331
17:34.079 --> 17:35.039
Captain Cheng was worried you'd overthink.

332
17:35.799 --> 17:36.759
I took a fall.

333
17:37.200 --> 17:38.200
I didn't lose my mind.

334
17:38.400 --> 17:38.880
Okay?

335
17:39.920 --> 17:41.279
Any leads on Tu Chunyan's case?

336
17:45.000 --> 17:46.640
But I went back yesterday

337
17:46.799 --> 17:48.200
to the crime scene

338
17:48.200 --> 17:49.160
we checked on day one.

339
17:49.839 --> 17:51.000
Now I'm completely sure

340
17:51.079 --> 17:51.839
this case

341
17:52.200 --> 17:54.039
was done by an old-timer from the plant.

342
17:54.400 --> 17:54.720
Right.

343
17:56.480 --> 17:57.319
The killer

344
17:57.759 --> 17:59.599
knew the route so well during the crime.

345
18:00.200 --> 18:00.880
Must be an old-timer.

346
18:01.880 --> 18:03.079
Yesterday, I put myself back

347
18:03.079 --> 18:04.640
into Ma Guowen's final moments.

348
18:06.839 --> 18:08.240
The killer had already killed him,

349
18:08.880 --> 18:10.480
yet still hauled him onto the tracks

350
18:10.680 --> 18:12.599
just so a train would crush him to pieces.

351
18:13.000 --> 18:13.720
What kind of mindset is that?

352
18:14.039 --> 18:14.640
How deep was that grudge?

353
18:15.880 --> 18:18.079
The killer harbored a deep grudge against Ma Guowen.

354
18:19.920 --> 18:22.039
That day, when I moved you from the office,

355
18:22.279 --> 18:24.039
carrying, hauling, and dragging you,

356
18:25.160 --> 18:25.960
think how much effort it took,

357
18:26.039 --> 18:27.000
how much time it took,

358
18:27.000 --> 18:28.200
just to get you to the tracks.

359
18:29.559 --> 18:31.880
Yet the night the killer murdered him,

360
18:32.680 --> 18:33.880
it was howling with snow.

361
18:34.680 --> 18:35.519
Freezing cold.

362
18:36.200 --> 18:37.599
Killing someone was exhausting enough,

363
18:38.680 --> 18:41.759
yet sheer willpower dragged the body to the tracks.

364
18:42.799 --> 18:44.000
Behind such willpower,

365
18:44.319 --> 18:45.640
how immense must that hatred be?

366
18:46.759 --> 18:48.799
Didn't I already analyze that?

367
18:48.880 --> 18:49.839
You're just expanding on it

368
18:49.839 --> 18:50.519
and analyzing it all over again.

369
18:50.519 --> 18:51.480
No new information.

370
18:52.000 --> 18:53.319
I already checked out all of

371
18:53.319 --> 18:54.440
Ma Guowen's connections.

372
18:54.920 --> 18:56.599
Over the years, he really pissed off a lot of people.

373
18:58.920 --> 18:59.640
Come here.

374
19:00.319 --> 19:00.680
What?

375
19:00.920 --> 19:01.440
Come over here.

376
19:03.160 --> 19:04.319
Then we have to dig.

377
19:04.640 --> 19:06.559
Find who holds a deep grudge against Ma Guowen.

378
19:06.759 --> 19:08.160
Do you know what a deep grudge really is?

379
19:09.279 --> 19:10.480
Listen up.

380
19:11.640 --> 19:12.680
Stealing someone's true love,

381
19:13.000 --> 19:14.160
ruining their livelihood,

382
19:14.799 --> 19:15.599
killing their parents.

383
19:16.359 --> 19:17.920
That's a deep grudge.

384
19:19.119 --> 19:19.960
Stealing true love,

385
19:20.000 --> 19:20.640
killing parents,

386
19:20.640 --> 19:21.920
Ma Guowen never had the guts for that.

387
19:22.000 --> 19:23.160
Ruining livelihood is up for debate.

388
19:24.400 --> 19:24.920
Investigate it.

389
19:25.039 --> 19:26.480
Follow that lead.

390
19:26.480 --> 19:27.079
Got it?

391
19:28.680 --> 19:28.960
Fine.

392
19:29.640 --> 19:30.079
Understood.

393
19:34.440 --> 19:35.960
Lying here these past few days,

394
19:36.079 --> 19:37.720
gave me a new perspective

395
19:38.079 --> 19:39.480
and a new discovery.

396
19:40.480 --> 19:41.039
What perspective?

397
19:43.079 --> 19:44.000
Liu Xuemei.

398
19:51.519 --> 19:53.680
Didn't I tell you Liu Xuemei

399
19:53.680 --> 19:54.839
was connected to this case?

400
19:56.720 --> 19:57.200
Right, right, right.

401
19:57.200 --> 19:58.000
You did say that.

402
20:02.400 --> 20:04.839
Liu Xuemei really did hail a taxi

403
20:05.319 --> 20:07.519
from Qingzhou,

404
20:08.519 --> 20:10.640
and that cab belonged to Gao Xuelin's dad.

405
20:11.880 --> 20:13.799
No wonder every time she made a long-distance call,

406
20:13.799 --> 20:15.480
she came back beaming from ear to ear.

407
20:16.279 --> 20:18.799
The person connected to Liu Xuemei

408
20:19.839 --> 20:20.960
is right among them.

409
20:21.680 --> 20:22.359
It all makes sense now.

410
20:23.839 --> 20:24.880
This Gao Xuelin...

411
20:25.720 --> 20:27.400
He definitely has ties to Liu Xuemei.

412
20:28.759 --> 20:31.039
Vengeance is a dish best served cold.

413
20:32.119 --> 20:32.559
Look.

414
20:33.000 --> 20:35.359
Anyone who badmouthed Liu Xuemei

415
20:36.000 --> 20:37.039
was killed by him.

416
20:37.759 --> 20:39.039
Everyone who died had cursed Liu Xuemei.

417
20:39.880 --> 20:41.920
Ma Guowen said Liu Xuemei seduced him.

418
20:42.400 --> 20:44.119
Qian Yichuan called Liu Xuemei a traitor.

419
20:44.440 --> 20:45.240
What did Cao Jun say?

420
20:45.920 --> 20:47.559
Cao Jun never cursed Liu Xuemei.

421
20:48.400 --> 20:49.640
Then why was he killed?

422
20:50.960 --> 20:53.680
If the killer wanted revenge on Ma Guowen,

423
20:54.079 --> 20:56.440
why kill Cao Jun and Qian Yichuan, too?

424
20:56.799 --> 20:59.279
If the killer was Ma Guowen's accomplice,

425
20:59.599 --> 21:01.240
he'd have even less reason to turn on his partner.

426
21:01.480 --> 21:02.279
We all know

427
21:02.599 --> 21:04.519
Liu Xuemei went on everyone's behalf.

428
21:05.319 --> 21:06.319
After she died,

429
21:06.680 --> 21:07.680
she was branded a traitor.

430
21:07.880 --> 21:08.440
So this person

431
21:08.440 --> 21:10.279
must be out to avenge Xuemei!

432
21:11.440 --> 21:13.559
So the killer isn't on anyone's side.

433
21:14.079 --> 21:16.880
His target is everyone who abandoned Liu Xuemei.

434
21:17.640 --> 21:18.599
That fall wasn't in vain, man.

435
21:19.039 --> 21:20.039
It really cleared your head.

436
21:20.400 --> 21:21.160
Scoffing at me?

437
21:23.480 --> 21:25.279
No wonder the police couldn't crack the case.

438
21:25.640 --> 21:26.720
It was right under their noses!

439
21:27.640 --> 21:28.680
It's terrifying when you think about it.

440
21:31.240 --> 21:32.920
Could it be a group effort?

441
21:33.319 --> 21:34.480
You mean

442
21:34.920 --> 21:37.200
a group carried Ma Guowen to the tracks?

443
21:38.119 --> 21:38.839
Report him.

444
21:39.480 --> 21:40.480
All of us together,

445
21:41.000 --> 21:41.920
let's go report him.

446
21:42.640 --> 21:43.720
We can't tip him off.

447
21:44.440 --> 21:45.680
Right now, this is just speculation.

448
21:46.039 --> 21:47.519
We don't have hard evidence.

449
21:47.920 --> 21:49.720
The police won't arrest someone

450
21:49.720 --> 21:50.559
just because we suspect them,

451
21:50.680 --> 21:51.200
right?

452
21:51.480 --> 21:52.000
Don't worry.

453
21:52.000 --> 21:52.799
I can keep my cool.

454
21:52.799 --> 21:53.920
The messier it gets, the calmer I stay.

455
21:56.160 --> 21:56.839
I think

456
21:57.279 --> 21:58.720
you're all being too cautious.

457
21:59.079 --> 22:01.599
It's obvious this Gao guy did it, isn't it?

458
22:02.240 --> 22:02.720
Don't you think?

459
22:02.920 --> 22:03.559
In the past,

460
22:04.119 --> 22:04.880
the enemy was in the dark,

461
22:05.359 --> 22:06.000
and we were out in the open.

462
22:06.559 --> 22:08.039
Now we have the upper hand.

463
22:08.519 --> 22:09.440
We strike when they retreat!

464
22:12.880 --> 22:15.160
Still, everyone's in a state of panic now.

465
22:16.400 --> 22:17.119
We must crack the case quickly

466
22:17.279 --> 22:18.039
and catch the killer.

467
22:18.519 --> 22:19.720
As long as he's on the loose,

468
22:20.400 --> 22:22.119
none of us can sleep in peace.

469
22:24.079 --> 22:24.839
Rest assured.

470
22:26.359 --> 22:28.200
I won't let the killer get away with it.

471
22:43.079 --> 22:43.519
What's wrong?

472
22:43.519 --> 22:44.920
Why are you staring at me like that?

473
22:47.240 --> 22:48.799
Wait, did you get a lead or what?

474
22:51.960 --> 22:52.440
Recently,

475
22:52.799 --> 22:55.160
a series of bizarre murders hit Lacheng.

476
22:55.359 --> 22:56.480
All fingers of suspicion

477
22:56.480 --> 22:58.400
shockingly point to a police officer.

478
22:58.720 --> 23:00.359
Supposed to be a guardian of justice,

479
23:00.559 --> 23:02.640
he acted alone during work hours,

480
23:02.759 --> 23:03.640
behaving suspiciously.

481
23:04.039 --> 23:05.480
Even more chillingly,

482
23:05.640 --> 23:07.519
he appeared at crime scenes repeatedly.

483
23:07.720 --> 23:08.480
As an officer of the law,

484
23:08.640 --> 23:09.319
flouting regulations

485
23:09.319 --> 23:09.960
and abandoning morality.

486
23:10.799 --> 23:11.599
In this case,

487
23:11.599 --> 23:12.880
is the officer... Is that you?

488
23:12.880 --> 23:13.799
...falling from grace,

489
23:13.960 --> 23:16.680
or is there an untold secret behind it?

490
23:16.960 --> 23:18.680
100K News Guy brings you this report.

491
23:19.640 --> 23:21.079
Mom, I bought breakfast!

492
23:22.440 --> 23:25.200
Reporter Shen Leshui is back!

493
23:26.039 --> 23:27.200
Look at you, you've only been back a few days,

494
23:27.200 --> 23:27.799
sweetheart.

495
23:28.079 --> 23:28.640
Take a look at this!

496
23:28.960 --> 23:29.960
Exposing dirty cops!

497
23:30.160 --> 23:31.000
What?

498
23:31.000 --> 23:32.400
That's my baby girl!

499
23:32.400 --> 23:33.359
So brave!

500
23:33.400 --> 23:34.319
Awesome!

501
23:34.559 --> 23:35.720
Mom will heat up some milk for you,

502
23:35.799 --> 23:36.799
keep your strength up.

503
23:37.400 --> 23:38.079
Keep it up!

504
23:39.480 --> 23:41.480
My baby girl is amazing! Recently,

505
23:41.480 --> 23:43.319
a series of bizarre murders hit Lacheng.

506
23:43.720 --> 23:44.720
All fingers of suspicion

507
23:44.720 --> 23:46.680
shockingly point to a police officer.

508
23:46.920 --> 23:48.680
Supposed to be a guardian of justice,

509
23:48.839 --> 23:50.920
he acted alone during work hours,

510
23:51.079 --> 23:52.079
behaving suspiciously.

511
23:52.319 --> 23:53.839
Even more chillingly,

512
23:53.920 --> 23:55.799
he appeared at crime scenes repeatedly.

513
23:55.960 --> 23:56.920
As an officer of the law...

514
23:57.319 --> 23:58.599
The station is offering full support.

515
23:58.920 --> 23:59.920
The station bosses said

516
23:59.960 --> 24:01.319
we can launch a special feature.

517
24:01.759 --> 24:02.440
Once materials are ready,

518
24:02.480 --> 24:03.240
we will broadcast immediately.

519
24:04.119 --> 24:04.559
Sis,

520
24:05.240 --> 24:06.119
here is the contract.

521
24:06.119 --> 24:06.880
Take a look,

522
24:07.039 --> 24:08.000
and let's get the ball rolling.

523
24:08.480 --> 24:09.759
Why is it a company?

524
24:10.119 --> 24:11.160
Isn't it the TV station?

525
24:11.480 --> 24:12.880
It's a subsidiary under the station.

526
24:13.200 --> 24:14.160
Don't worry, Sis.

527
24:18.319 --> 24:18.960
Hello,

528
24:19.319 --> 24:21.279
the number you dialed is currently...

529
24:22.880 --> 24:24.079
Li Mingyang, answer the phone!

530
24:25.039 --> 24:25.880
Pick up the phone!

531
24:36.960 --> 24:37.599
Hello.

532
24:37.960 --> 24:39.240
The subscriber you dialed...

533
25:28.839 --> 25:31.000
All editing rights belong entirely to Party B.

534
25:31.200 --> 25:33.559
The right of final interpretation also belongs to Party B.

535
25:33.720 --> 25:34.799
Let me add one more for you.

536
25:35.160 --> 25:37.000
The byline on all published content

537
25:37.000 --> 25:37.920
must be Shen Leshui.

538
25:38.039 --> 25:38.880
To protect your copyright.

539
25:44.279 --> 25:45.079
Shen Leshui.

540
25:47.200 --> 25:48.799
Here's the production budget from the station.

541
25:49.039 --> 25:49.920
Exactly 30,000 yuan.

542
25:59.079 --> 26:00.839
Here's my cloud drive account and password.

543
26:01.400 --> 26:03.119
I've already uploaded some footage.

544
26:03.240 --> 26:05.480
Some of it isn't suitable to release yet.

545
26:06.279 --> 26:07.640
I need to sort through it first.

546
26:07.960 --> 26:08.880
Only post it when I tell you to.

547
26:09.119 --> 26:09.599
Got it.

548
26:09.759 --> 26:10.519
Whatever you say.

549
26:29.359 --> 26:31.279
Please pull up the previous clip.

550
26:34.359 --> 26:34.720
Right.

551
26:34.799 --> 26:35.880
Pause it right here.

552
26:37.000 --> 26:37.759
Captain Cheng,

553
26:38.319 --> 26:40.440
in these videos, I was on my regular shift,

554
26:40.599 --> 26:41.799
investigating leads at the scene.

555
26:42.160 --> 26:43.799
In this exact shot of the video,

556
26:44.160 --> 26:45.440
Sister Cai was standing right next to me.

557
26:46.119 --> 26:46.680
Right.

558
26:46.960 --> 26:48.640
I was right in front of him.

559
26:49.759 --> 26:51.079
Wait, but in this video,

560
26:51.400 --> 26:52.559
how come I'm gone?

561
26:53.160 --> 26:54.759
They used editing tricks

562
26:55.000 --> 26:56.279
specifically to target Gao Xuelin.

563
26:59.079 --> 26:59.759
I'm a cop,

564
26:59.759 --> 27:01.839
and they've turned me into a criminal suspect!

565
27:04.079 --> 27:04.880
Captain Cheng,

566
27:05.319 --> 27:07.160
Shen Leshui filmed all these videos.

567
27:08.119 --> 27:09.799
Can you assign someone to go with me now?

568
27:10.319 --> 27:11.319
I'll go to her place and ask her

569
27:11.400 --> 27:12.400
why she did this.

570
27:12.759 --> 27:15.119
What was her motive for doing this?

571
27:15.319 --> 27:16.720
What does she want from me?

572
27:18.119 --> 27:19.319
I'll set up an investigation team

573
27:19.880 --> 27:21.279
specifically to look into this matter.

574
27:21.640 --> 27:22.920
The only thing you can do right now

575
27:23.400 --> 27:24.799
is cooperate with the department's inquiry.

576
27:26.160 --> 27:26.960
During this time,

577
27:27.279 --> 27:28.680
you cannot meet Shen Leshui alone.

578
27:30.599 --> 27:31.359
Not just her.

579
27:31.920 --> 27:33.319
Anyone from that public account,

580
27:33.759 --> 27:34.680
you're not allowed to see them.

581
27:36.160 --> 27:36.960
Regarding this matter,

582
27:37.160 --> 27:38.440
we must clear it up as soon as possible,

583
27:38.680 --> 27:39.680
and handle it with the utmost seriousness.

584
27:40.440 --> 27:40.839
Understood.

585
27:41.599 --> 27:42.400
Gao,

586
27:43.319 --> 27:44.240
the department's decision

587
27:44.680 --> 27:45.680
is for you to be suspended from duty for now.

588
27:46.519 --> 27:47.799
I can't be suspended!

589
27:48.759 --> 27:49.559
Captain Cheng,

590
27:50.039 --> 27:51.480
so many cases are still unsolved.

591
27:51.759 --> 27:53.319
My brother is lying in the hospital right now,

592
27:53.319 --> 27:54.599
and I should stop working?

593
27:56.200 --> 27:57.119
Clear this up quickly,

594
27:57.480 --> 27:58.680
and keep me updated at all times.

595
27:59.240 --> 27:59.920
Gao,

596
28:00.319 --> 28:01.240
doing this

597
28:01.400 --> 28:02.359
is also for your own good.

598
28:02.880 --> 28:03.920
I hope you can understand.

599
28:04.440 --> 28:05.279
Once it's cleared up,

600
28:05.799 --> 28:07.039
you'll be reinstated immediately.

601
28:10.359 --> 28:11.119
I understand then.

602
28:11.319 --> 28:11.759
All right, then.

603
28:15.839 --> 28:16.279
Recently,

604
28:16.680 --> 28:18.920
a series of bizarre murders shocked Lacheng.

605
28:19.319 --> 28:20.319
The finger of suspicion

606
28:20.319 --> 28:22.039
shockingly points to a police officer.

607
28:27.359 --> 28:27.960
Guo,

608
28:29.079 --> 28:30.200
when can I be discharged?

609
28:30.319 --> 28:31.079
Go ask for me.

610
28:31.599 --> 28:32.640
I have a ton of things to deal with out there.

611
28:32.640 --> 28:34.000
I'm already burning with anxiety.

612
28:34.200 --> 28:35.920
The doctor prescribed medicine to clear your internal heat.

613
28:36.039 --> 28:36.960
Please remember to take it.

614
28:37.039 --> 28:38.279
Meds won't help!

615
28:38.359 --> 28:38.839
Just ask...

616
28:38.839 --> 28:40.119
Ask them when I can be discharged,

617
28:40.160 --> 28:40.480
will you?

618
28:40.480 --> 28:41.640
Let me take your blood pressure again.

619
28:41.680 --> 28:43.200
It was normal all three times today!

620
28:43.200 --> 28:44.400
Don't—don't measure it.

621
28:44.440 --> 28:45.519
Put it away, please?

622
28:45.640 --> 28:46.440
Just ask for me...

623
28:50.119 --> 28:50.400
I'm sorry.

624
28:50.400 --> 28:51.519
I'm not taking it out on you, okay?

625
28:59.640 --> 29:00.400
Are you here

626
29:01.720 --> 29:02.920
because of Gao Xuelin?

627
29:04.640 --> 29:05.519
Has he been here?

628
29:06.960 --> 29:07.640
How could he come?

629
29:09.640 --> 29:11.279
He's probably under investigation right now.

630
29:12.119 --> 29:12.960
Just now,

631
29:14.119 --> 29:14.960
I checked your account,

632
29:15.480 --> 29:16.880
and it called him a murderer.

633
29:21.960 --> 29:22.920
Some of that footage

634
29:24.000 --> 29:24.880
was shot by me,

635
29:26.200 --> 29:26.839
but I didn't edit it,

636
29:26.839 --> 29:27.880
and I didn't post it.

637
29:28.960 --> 29:30.319
I do suspect him,

638
29:30.839 --> 29:32.759
but I'd never make things up just on suspicion.

639
29:33.119 --> 29:35.119
Gao Xuelin isn't the killer.

640
29:36.880 --> 29:38.279
The night I was attacked,

641
29:38.799 --> 29:40.039
Gao was at the station.

642
29:40.279 --> 29:41.359
There are witnesses.

643
29:42.279 --> 29:42.920
Then why does he

644
29:42.920 --> 29:44.640
keep fixating on Liu Xuemei?

645
29:45.119 --> 29:46.039
What's his dad's connection to Liu Xuemei?

646
29:46.039 --> 29:47.119
Leshui, that's for the police

647
29:47.119 --> 29:48.720
to investigate, all right?

648
29:52.240 --> 29:53.440
Investigating a case

649
29:54.160 --> 29:55.000
requires objective facts,

650
29:55.000 --> 29:56.480
not subjective assumptions.

651
29:57.240 --> 29:58.640
Yet some people choose to believe

652
29:58.759 --> 30:00.920
whatever confirms their preconceptions,

653
30:00.920 --> 30:02.799
while ignoring anything to the contrary.

654
30:04.400 --> 30:04.799
I...

655
30:07.279 --> 30:08.160
Never mind me.

656
30:08.559 --> 30:09.640
I'm just anxious.

657
30:10.440 --> 30:11.799
I didn't mean to lecture you.

658
30:15.039 --> 30:16.200
Gao has been suspended.

659
30:17.799 --> 30:18.599
Three cases.

660
30:19.319 --> 30:20.720
None of the three have been solved.

661
30:22.839 --> 30:24.079
It's on me.

662
30:28.960 --> 30:30.480
I got conned by a guy named Li Mingyang.

663
30:32.599 --> 30:33.880
After all these years,

664
30:35.440 --> 30:37.240
I really slipped up.

665
30:41.319 --> 30:42.240
What happened?

666
30:47.079 --> 30:47.640
Don't worry.

667
30:48.079 --> 30:50.000
I'll find a way to give you all an explanation.

668
31:43.680 --> 31:44.440
What are you doing?

669
31:46.359 --> 31:47.279
You fraud!

670
31:47.359 --> 31:48.480
You shameless jerk!

671
31:54.119 --> 31:54.799
Have you lost your mind?

672
31:54.839 --> 31:56.119
Why are you smashing my car?

673
31:56.480 --> 31:58.200
Stop smashing it! What's wrong with you?

674
31:59.839 --> 32:00.519
Who is this woman?

675
32:00.720 --> 32:01.440
Is she crazy?

676
32:02.000 --> 32:02.759
Why smash the car?

677
32:02.759 --> 32:03.720
Are you out of your mind?

678
32:04.240 --> 32:05.160
Stop smashing it!

679
32:05.359 --> 32:06.000
Stop it!

680
32:06.359 --> 32:07.200
You're crazy!

681
32:07.759 --> 32:10.119
Li Mingyang, stop playing innocent with me!

682
32:10.200 --> 32:11.160
Why don't you tell everyone...

683
32:11.160 --> 32:12.440
...that you've been moonlighting?

684
32:12.720 --> 32:13.559
Stop talking nonsense!

685
32:13.559 --> 32:14.640
Who's moonlighting?

686
32:14.880 --> 32:16.319
What the hell is wrong with you?

687
32:18.000 --> 32:18.960
You fraud!

688
32:19.359 --> 32:20.319
You stole my footage! Let go of me!

689
32:20.319 --> 32:20.759
I'm telling you!

690
32:20.759 --> 32:21.759
Edited it maliciously! Let go!

691
32:22.240 --> 32:23.759
You even posted it under my name!

692
32:24.240 --> 32:25.240
Slandering the police...

693
32:25.240 --> 32:26.200
how could you do that?

694
32:26.279 --> 32:27.480
Just wait until you end up in prison!

695
32:27.920 --> 32:29.920
I'm telling you, stop talking nonsense!

696
32:31.599 --> 32:32.519
What does this have to do with you?

697
32:32.680 --> 32:33.759
Stop right there!

698
32:38.359 --> 32:39.160
Hitting someone, are you?

699
32:39.400 --> 32:40.240
I'm calling the police!

700
32:40.680 --> 32:41.839
Go ahead, call them!

701
32:42.000 --> 32:43.559
Let the cops investigate you thoroughly!

702
32:43.680 --> 32:44.440
Call them, then!

703
32:44.839 --> 32:45.440
What police? Call them!

704
32:45.440 --> 32:46.079
Put your phones down, all of you!

705
32:46.079 --> 32:46.920
Call the police, everyone!

706
32:47.359 --> 32:47.839
Call them!

707
32:48.599 --> 32:49.640
Weren't you going to call the police?

708
32:49.880 --> 32:50.440
Call them! Put that down!

709
32:50.440 --> 32:51.400
Whoever doesn't call is a coward!

710
32:51.400 --> 32:52.039
What police? Go ahead and call!

711
32:52.039 --> 32:52.920
Put your phone down! Call them!

712
32:52.920 --> 32:53.680
You fraud! Don't call!

713
32:53.680 --> 32:55.039
You even dared to spread rumors about the cops!

714
32:55.039 --> 32:56.160
How impressive!

715
32:56.480 --> 32:57.039
Let go of me!

716
32:57.039 --> 32:58.559
I'm telling you, you've gone mad!

717
32:58.799 --> 33:00.119
You psycho!

718
33:00.519 --> 33:01.920
Li Mingyang, let me tell you!

719
33:02.359 --> 33:03.599
You won't get away with this!

720
33:03.640 --> 33:04.279
Let go!

721
33:04.599 --> 33:05.799
I said, you're out of your mind!

722
33:06.000 --> 33:07.920
Justice will definitely catch up with you!

723
33:08.079 --> 33:09.079
Just wait to rot in jail!

724
33:09.480 --> 33:10.720
What are you looking at? Break it up!

725
33:11.680 --> 33:12.720
Li Mingyang!

726
33:31.079 --> 33:31.799
Shen Leshui.

727
33:33.599 --> 33:34.200
That's me.

728
33:34.839 --> 33:35.440
Li Mingyang.

729
33:35.720 --> 33:36.160
Yes.

730
33:36.279 --> 33:37.000
This way, you two.

731
33:37.960 --> 33:38.440
Zhang,

732
33:38.920 --> 33:40.440
pull up the surveillance footage and let them see it.

733
33:49.519 --> 33:50.119
Alright.

734
33:50.240 --> 33:50.920
Tell me what happened.

735
33:52.319 --> 33:53.400
She smashed my car for no reason!

736
33:53.680 --> 33:54.799
No reason?

737
33:55.519 --> 33:57.359
He wrote the article framing Officer Gao!

738
33:57.480 --> 33:58.720
What makes you say I wrote it?

739
33:58.880 --> 33:59.720
Is my name on it?

740
33:59.960 --> 34:00.920
I gave that to the TV station!

741
34:00.920 --> 34:01.759
You stole it!

742
34:02.119 --> 34:02.759
Officers,

743
34:03.079 --> 34:04.319
framing a public official is a crime.

744
34:04.440 --> 34:05.960
Please uncover the truth

745
34:05.960 --> 34:06.880
and clear Officer Gao's name!

746
34:07.279 --> 34:08.320
Let me tell you, Shen Leshui,

747
34:08.480 --> 34:09.800
cut the good-guy act, will you?

748
34:09.920 --> 34:11.280
Didn't you give me that info?

749
34:11.800 --> 34:12.440
Officers,

750
34:12.559 --> 34:13.320
I have a contract.

751
34:13.519 --> 34:14.880
I hold the final editing rights.

752
34:15.079 --> 34:15.800
Without my permission,

753
34:15.840 --> 34:16.800
he had no right to publish it.

754
34:17.480 --> 34:18.039
Officer,

755
34:18.679 --> 34:20.000
she sold me that footage!

756
34:20.079 --> 34:21.320
Covering this story was her idea, too!

757
34:21.440 --> 34:22.079
I have a recording!

758
34:23.480 --> 34:24.159
A recording?

759
34:25.400 --> 34:26.079
When did you record me?

760
34:27.360 --> 34:28.360
Did you edit that, too?

761
34:29.000 --> 34:30.320
Why are you so obsessed with editing?

762
34:30.320 --> 34:31.519
Cutting video, cutting audio...

763
34:31.519 --> 34:32.360
Are you a crab or something?

764
34:32.559 --> 34:34.119
Stop talking out of your ass!

765
34:34.119 --> 34:34.719
Shen Leshui!

766
34:34.719 --> 34:35.679
First you framed Officer Gao,

767
34:35.679 --> 34:36.599
and now you're framing me?

768
34:36.599 --> 34:38.559
Me framing you? You're the framing expert!

769
34:38.679 --> 34:39.519
Let the police investigate! Me, framing you?

770
34:39.840 --> 34:40.519
What did I do?

771
34:40.639 --> 34:41.199
What did I do wrong?

772
34:41.199 --> 34:41.880
Hey, both of you! 100K News Guy!

773
34:41.880 --> 34:42.440
Am I wrong?

774
34:42.440 --> 34:43.280
Calm down, calm down. No,

775
34:43.480 --> 34:43.920
calm down!

776
34:44.840 --> 34:45.559
The two of you...

777
34:46.079 --> 34:47.400
One damaged someone's property,

778
34:47.400 --> 34:48.280
and the other got into a brawl.

779
34:48.360 --> 34:49.840
You've severely disrupted public security

780
34:49.840 --> 34:50.599
and social order.

781
34:51.039 --> 34:52.280
Neither of you seems remotely remorseful.

782
34:52.559 --> 34:53.719
How about finding a place to cool off

783
34:53.800 --> 34:54.280
and reflect on yourselves?

784
34:54.360 --> 34:55.320
He framed a cop! And he framed me!

785
34:55.960 --> 34:57.639
We're currently investigating the defamation.

786
34:58.920 --> 35:00.039
Until that's cleared up,

787
35:00.480 --> 35:01.280
neither of you is leaving.

788
35:01.880 --> 35:02.280
Zhang!

789
35:03.360 --> 35:03.880
Wait, Officer!

790
35:03.960 --> 35:05.039
-She framed me! -Calm down.

791
35:05.039 --> 35:06.440
-I had nothing to do with it! -Calm down.

792
35:06.559 --> 35:07.360
Calm down first.

793
35:07.360 --> 35:08.480
Reflect on your actions. Come on, follow me.

794
35:10.360 --> 35:10.920
Xiao Li,

795
35:11.519 --> 35:12.280
take him away first.

796
35:20.320 --> 35:21.639
As for the video on the public account,

797
35:21.800 --> 35:22.840
we've already investigated it.

798
35:26.800 --> 35:28.159
We checked the surveillance footage in the neighborhood.

799
35:29.440 --> 35:30.320
It proves that

800
35:30.480 --> 35:32.920
Gao Xuelin was on regular duty that night.

801
35:33.880 --> 35:35.119
Judging by the timeline,

802
35:35.519 --> 35:36.559
the person he was chasing

803
35:36.760 --> 35:38.760
is very likely the one who stole your tape.

804
35:41.320 --> 35:42.519
I misjudged him.

805
35:44.320 --> 35:46.400
Disturbing public order has been cleared up,

806
35:46.800 --> 35:49.079
but the smear campaign against the police hasn't.

807
35:49.400 --> 35:50.119
You can't leave yet.

808
35:50.800 --> 35:51.760
What do you mean?

809
35:52.039 --> 35:53.519
You gave the footage to Li Mingyang,

810
35:53.719 --> 35:54.679
but the one who published it

811
35:54.679 --> 35:56.679
was the public account 100K News Guy.

812
35:57.639 --> 35:58.719
We looked into that account.

813
35:59.079 --> 36:00.280
The registered owner is Miao Yuzhu.

814
36:00.599 --> 36:01.719
Do you have proof

815
36:01.719 --> 36:03.840
that Li Mingyang is 100K News Guy?

816
36:04.880 --> 36:05.840
How can you prove

817
36:05.840 --> 36:07.159
that Li Mingyang smeared the police

818
36:07.360 --> 36:08.280
and not you?

819
36:11.679 --> 36:12.760
It's my fault.

820
36:13.760 --> 36:16.519
You don't have concrete proof that they scammed you,

821
36:17.280 --> 36:18.360
so there's no way

822
36:18.360 --> 36:20.360
to hold them criminally liable for this incident.

823
36:23.480 --> 36:24.199
Understood.

824
36:25.960 --> 36:28.639
Only my smashing the car can be prosecuted.

825
36:30.760 --> 36:32.559
Shen Leshui claims she was scammed,

826
36:32.880 --> 36:34.840
and that Li Mingyang orchestrated the fake news.

827
36:37.199 --> 36:37.639
Got it.

828
36:39.079 --> 36:40.119
What was Shen Leshui thinking?

829
36:40.800 --> 36:42.679
She sold so much of your footage to Li Mingyang,

830
36:43.239 --> 36:44.719
and now she turns around claiming she was tricked.

831
36:46.800 --> 36:48.920
What's going on in her head?

832
36:49.320 --> 36:50.960
Handle it however you need to.

833
36:51.239 --> 36:52.039
Don't worry about me.

834
36:55.639 --> 36:56.400
Miao Yuzhu is here.

835
36:56.679 --> 36:57.440
Come with me to question her.

836
37:00.400 --> 37:02.360
What does their fight have to do with me?

837
37:02.639 --> 37:03.719
Why did you bring me here?

838
37:09.159 --> 37:10.599
You run a public account, right?

839
37:11.280 --> 37:11.840
Yes.

840
37:12.239 --> 37:13.400
I have an account

841
37:13.400 --> 37:14.480
called Miao's Eloquence,

842
37:14.760 --> 37:17.000
and another called 100K News Guy.

843
37:17.360 --> 37:18.360
That's my media matrix.

844
37:18.679 --> 37:19.239
Is that illegal?

845
37:19.519 --> 37:20.519
It's not against the law, is it?

846
37:21.519 --> 37:23.000
Do you know what was posted

847
37:23.000 --> 37:23.840
on that account of yours?

848
37:24.599 --> 37:25.719
Trending news, of course.

849
37:26.400 --> 37:27.320
What happened at Lacheng Brewery

850
37:27.320 --> 37:28.559
was all over the news.

851
37:28.559 --> 37:30.239
Why can't I cover it on my account?

852
37:32.039 --> 37:32.639
Please, have a seat.

853
37:37.039 --> 37:38.960
I really didn't do anything wrong.

854
37:39.639 --> 37:41.519
If my posts violated any rules,

855
37:41.519 --> 37:42.800
they wouldn't have gone through.

856
37:43.119 --> 37:44.599
Reporting on Lacheng Brewery is fine, right?

857
37:45.000 --> 37:46.800
Reporting on police investigations is fine, right?

858
37:47.159 --> 37:49.519
Then why is reporting on cops at Lacheng Brewery

859
37:49.519 --> 37:50.639
not fine?

860
37:50.760 --> 37:51.320
Sit down.

861
37:53.239 --> 37:54.159
Stop deflecting.

862
37:55.119 --> 37:56.119
Did we ask about that?

863
37:56.599 --> 37:58.159
The footage Shen Leshui had,

864
37:58.440 --> 37:59.440
where did you get it?

865
37:59.800 --> 38:00.960
Did you obtain it through legal means?

866
38:01.440 --> 38:02.280
Are you implying

867
38:02.280 --> 38:03.119
that I scammed her?

868
38:04.440 --> 38:06.360
Scamming her wouldn't even be worth the effort.

869
38:06.800 --> 38:08.679
If her footage was so valuable,

870
38:09.000 --> 38:10.960
why didn't other accounts try to scam her?

871
38:11.480 --> 38:12.840
I offered 80,000,

872
38:13.000 --> 38:14.280
and she sold it willingly.

873
38:15.480 --> 38:16.440
Is there a bank transfer record?

874
38:17.159 --> 38:17.920
Not for this.

875
38:18.320 --> 38:19.599
We dealt strictly in cash.

876
38:19.800 --> 38:20.519
She requested it.

877
38:36.960 --> 38:37.480
Guo.

878
38:38.679 --> 38:39.679
How many bags do I have left today?

879
38:39.760 --> 38:40.719
There's still one bag left.

880
38:50.360 --> 38:50.840
Chuang,

881
38:51.280 --> 38:52.639
Miao Yuzhu is damn slippery.

882
38:53.039 --> 38:54.000
I had no choice but to let her go.

883
38:54.440 --> 38:55.880
Do you know their company address?

884
38:57.360 --> 38:59.039
78 Chunping Road,

885
38:59.320 --> 38:59.760
third floor.

886
39:00.199 --> 39:01.239
Miao's Eloquence Studio.

887
39:01.239 --> 39:02.599
Uncover the truth behind the murder,

888
39:03.000 --> 39:04.039
find the real culprit,

889
39:04.239 --> 39:05.440
and restore justice to society.

890
39:05.800 --> 39:06.679
Stay tuned!

891
39:10.440 --> 39:11.280
Officers,

892
39:12.000 --> 39:13.199
I didn't write the article,

893
39:13.199 --> 39:14.440
and I didn't post the video.

894
39:14.440 --> 39:15.960
This has nothing to do with me.

895
39:16.199 --> 39:17.760
Look, you already let me go.

896
39:17.760 --> 39:19.119
That proves I'm innocent.

897
39:19.119 --> 39:20.360
Why are you coming back for me?

898
39:20.440 --> 39:22.440
You should be going after Shen Leshui right now.

899
39:22.480 --> 39:23.840
She provided all of it.

900
39:24.000 --> 39:26.639
Then why did she say you stole it from her?

901
39:27.239 --> 39:28.159
Officers,

902
39:28.320 --> 39:30.119
I don't agree with that at all.

903
39:30.360 --> 39:31.440
It was an open collaboration.

904
39:31.440 --> 39:32.320
How is that stealing?

905
39:32.320 --> 39:33.239
Claiming I posted unverified fake news—

906
39:33.239 --> 39:34.559
claiming I posted unverified fake news!

907
39:34.639 --> 39:36.960
I wasn't happy about getting fined either!

908
39:38.639 --> 39:39.360
Don't get worked up.

909
39:39.519 --> 39:41.760
Aren't we here to verify it with you now?

910
39:42.960 --> 39:44.199
Maybe there was an error in the information,

911
39:44.199 --> 39:44.719
right?

912
39:45.719 --> 39:46.880
You're quite the big shot, Miao.

913
39:46.880 --> 39:47.239
Right?

914
39:47.920 --> 39:49.599
You used to be a journalist, didn't you?

915
39:50.199 --> 39:50.719
Yes.

916
39:51.079 --> 39:52.599
Worked at the TV station for years.

917
39:54.000 --> 39:55.639
So how news should be handled...

918
39:55.960 --> 39:56.960
you know better than we do.

919
39:57.199 --> 39:57.920
Of course.

920
39:58.840 --> 40:00.840
If your report is true,

921
40:01.239 --> 40:03.119
and provided clues to help solve the case,

922
40:03.920 --> 40:06.360
I think you deserve praise and a reward.

923
40:08.159 --> 40:08.880
Naturally.

924
40:09.480 --> 40:10.239
Of course,

925
40:11.159 --> 40:13.039
if this report is false,

926
40:13.760 --> 40:15.599
misdirected our investigation,

927
40:15.960 --> 40:17.559
and maliciously slandered the police...

928
40:18.760 --> 40:19.159
Cai,

929
40:20.039 --> 40:22.159
take the PRC Criminal Law,

930
40:22.159 --> 40:24.199
the relevant clauses of Article 246,

931
40:24.519 --> 40:25.599
and read them to Miao.

932
40:31.000 --> 40:33.199
Under the criminal penalty regulations,

933
40:33.199 --> 40:35.480
the offender will face criminal liability.

934
40:35.920 --> 40:38.360
In serious cases, one may be sentenced to

935
40:38.400 --> 40:41.039
up to three years in prison,

936
40:41.559 --> 40:44.639
criminal detention, public surveillance, or loss of political rights.

937
40:45.039 --> 40:46.039
What's more, we'll suspect

938
40:46.039 --> 40:47.840
your motives for publishing this report.

939
40:48.599 --> 40:50.599
You'll be listed as a criminal suspect.

940
40:52.159 --> 40:54.199
Why on earth should I be a suspect?

941
40:54.480 --> 40:55.480
Didn't your phone just ring? You guys...

942
40:55.480 --> 40:57.079
should be going after Shen Leshui and Li Mingyang now.

943
40:57.280 --> 40:58.960
They're the ones who are suspects!

944
40:59.679 --> 41:00.360
Calm down.

945
41:00.639 --> 41:01.039
Alright.

946
41:03.480 --> 41:03.920
What's going on?

947
41:04.440 --> 41:04.840
Fessed up.

948
41:05.880 --> 41:06.519
Fessed up?

949
41:06.800 --> 41:07.599
That was fast.

950
41:08.079 --> 41:08.679
Fessed up to everything.

951
41:10.239 --> 41:10.760
Let me see.

952
41:15.800 --> 41:16.679
Who fessed up?

953
41:21.039 --> 41:21.559
Miao Yuzhu.

954
41:22.480 --> 41:23.079
Who fessed up?

955
41:23.079 --> 41:23.800
Fessed up to what?

956
41:24.119 --> 41:25.199
I certainly can't tell you.

957
41:25.920 --> 41:27.039
But this matter

958
41:27.239 --> 41:28.639
has nothing to do with Li Mingyang.

959
41:30.079 --> 41:31.480
Nothing to do with him?

960
41:31.679 --> 41:33.519
Then isn't he just crying thief?

961
41:33.519 --> 41:35.000
How could he be crying thief?

962
41:35.280 --> 41:36.480
This public account isn't his.

963
41:36.719 --> 41:39.000
Isn't this account called Miao's Eloquence?

964
41:39.079 --> 41:40.400
Miao's Eloquence, right?

965
41:40.400 --> 41:41.480
Whose account is Miao's Eloquence?

966
41:42.159 --> 41:42.679
Whose?

967
41:43.400 --> 41:44.920
It's under my name,

968
41:44.920 --> 41:46.320
but in reality, it's his!

969
41:46.320 --> 41:47.599
So are you involved?

970
41:51.599 --> 41:52.119
No...

971
41:52.360 --> 41:53.159
I mean...

972
41:54.360 --> 41:55.199
it's not like...

973
41:55.480 --> 41:56.960
I'm completely uninvolved.

974
41:57.239 --> 41:58.679
Then how involved are you?

975
41:59.599 --> 42:01.679
Just this tiny little bit.

976
42:02.000 --> 42:02.679
So you're...

977
42:03.320 --> 42:04.360
a tiny little bit involved.

978
42:05.000 --> 42:07.840
Then I suggest you take this tiny little bit

979
42:08.119 --> 42:08.679
and tell us everything.

980
42:09.119 --> 42:10.480
Then you won't be involved anymore.

981
42:10.880 --> 42:12.800
Under our studio,

982
42:12.800 --> 42:14.800
all the video content on our public accounts

983
42:15.079 --> 42:17.280
was selected and finalized by Li Mingyang.

984
42:17.679 --> 42:18.639
The video content

985
42:18.639 --> 42:21.400
was also edited under Li Mingyang's orders.

986
42:21.760 --> 42:23.840
Li Mingyang is 100K News Guy.

987
42:23.840 --> 42:25.559
100K News Guy is Li Mingyang.

988
42:27.000 --> 42:29.360
Are you telling the truth this time?

989
42:29.800 --> 42:31.320
I swear on my honor,

990
42:31.480 --> 42:32.679
every word is true.

991
42:48.400 --> 42:48.760
Let's go.

992
43:02.280 --> 43:04.320
Do you think this even counts as news?

993
43:08.280 --> 43:08.840
All right.

994
43:09.159 --> 43:10.480
Your name's been cleared, too.

995
43:11.679 --> 43:12.760
Miao Yuzhu has been arrested,

996
43:12.960 --> 43:14.079
Shen Leshui went to testify,

997
43:15.199 --> 43:16.320
and barring any surprises,

998
43:16.559 --> 43:17.880
Li Mingyang will be arrested, too.

999
43:19.079 --> 43:20.039
It's all sorted out.

1000
43:20.480 --> 43:21.079
You're in the clear.

1001
43:22.440 --> 43:24.400
Self-media accounts like theirs,

1002
43:24.880 --> 43:26.519
if they break the law

1003
43:26.920 --> 43:28.480
by maliciously spreading rumors and twisting facts,

1004
43:29.039 --> 43:30.679
will definitely face justice.

1005
43:33.159 --> 43:33.679
Without a doubt.

1006
43:33.840 --> 43:34.360
You're nuts.

1007
43:35.159 --> 43:36.079
I'm back on the job.

1008
43:36.159 --> 43:36.760
Get to work.

1009
43:37.039 --> 43:37.800
Congrats.

1010
43:42.000 --> 43:43.079
Over a decade ago,

1011
43:43.920 --> 43:44.920
right at this gate,

1012
43:45.440 --> 43:46.559
we trusted you once.

1013
43:48.360 --> 43:49.360
Now,

1014
43:49.760 --> 43:51.480
I trusted you again.

1015
43:52.519 --> 43:53.840
Sell your house and get the hell out.

1016
43:54.239 --> 43:55.639
I never want to see you again.

1017
43:57.480 --> 43:58.320
I'm sorry.

1018
43:59.320 --> 44:00.159
Hypocrite.

1019
44:01.079 --> 44:02.119
These tapes

1020
44:02.400 --> 44:03.199
are damaged.

1021
44:03.400 --> 44:04.440
I marked them for you.

1022
44:04.519 --> 44:05.280
Damn it.
